{
  "slug": "sentinel-kb",
  "name": "Sentinel Kb",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Security vulnerability scanner backed by 2134 real findings extracted from 361 audit reports by 58 professional firms (Trail of Bits, Cure53, NCC Group, QuarksLab, and more). Includes 40+ static analysis rules across OWASP categories and a searchable knowledge base of real-world vulnerabilities. Static scan is instant and offline. Claude uses the KB context to perform deep security analysis — finding logic bugs, attack chains, and issues that regex rules miss.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (4): `audit` (Run a comprehensive security audit on a codebase using static rules + KB context), `scan-file` (Scan a single file for security vulnerabilities), `search` (Search the vulnerability knowledge base for patterns, CVEs, or attack types), `stats` (Show knowledge base statistics — findings, firms, categories, models)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `sentinel-kb`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sentinel-kb@claude-community` from `dolfrin/Sentinel-KB`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "command": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
